of the primary producers</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="particularly in Kelan County and Wuzhai County">particularly in Kelan County and Wuzhai County</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="Due to its unique geographical location and climate conditions">Due to its unique geographical location and climate conditions</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="The red kidney beans produced here are large">The red kidney beans produced here are large</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="bright">bright</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="sweet in taste">sweet in taste</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="warm in nature">warm in nature</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="high in calcium">high in calcium</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="low in sugar">low in sugar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="and high in fiber while low in fat">and high in fiber while low in fat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="making them a recognized green and pollution-free food">making them a recognized green and pollution-free food</span>.</p><p>Inoltre, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="Hebei Province">Hebei Province</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region">Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="and Heilongjiang Province are also important areas for red kidney bean cultivation">and Heilongjiang Province are also important areas for red kidney bean cultivation</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="The Zhangjiakou area in Hebei Province">The Zhangjiakou area in Hebei Province</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="including Huai&#8217;an">including Huai&#8217;an</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="Yangyuan">Yangyuan</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="and Zhuolu">and Zhuolu</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="has significant red kidney bean production">has significant red kidney bean production</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="There is also some cultivation in Inner Mongolia and Heilongjiang">There is also some cultivation in Inner Mongolia and Heilongjiang</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="Overall">Overall</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="the main production areas for red kidney beans in China include Kelan and Wuzhai Counties in Shanxi">the main production areas for red kidney beans in China include Kelan and Wuzhai Counties in Shanxi</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="Zhangjiakou in Hebei">Zhangjiakou in Hebei</span>, Mongolia interiore, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="and Heilongjiang">and Heilongjiang</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="The climate and soil conditions in these regions are very suitable for growing red kidney beans">The climate and soil conditions in these regions are very suitable for growing red kidney beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="making them the primary cultivation areas">making them the primary cultivation areas</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Nutritional_Structure_of_Red_Kidney_Beans"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="Nutritional Structure of Red Kidney Beans">Nutritional Structure of Red Kidney Beans</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="Red kidney beans are favored for their undeniable nutritional value">Red kidney beans are favored for their undeniable nutritional value</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="They are a nutrient-dense food">They are a nutrient-dense food</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="which can be analyzed in terms of protein">which can be analyzed in terms of protein</span>, carboidrati, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="fiber">fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="fats">fats</span>, vitamine, e minerali.</p><ul><li><strong>Proteina:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="Red kidney beans have a high protein content">Red kidney beans have a high protein content</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="with approximately">with approximately</span> 23.1 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="grams of protein per">grams of protein per</span> 100 grammi, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="as noted in a">as noted in a</span> 2011 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="report on Sina News">report on Sina News</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="The quality of this protein is high and similar to animal protein">The quality of this protein is high and similar to animal protein</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="making it an important nutritional source for the human body">making it an important nutritional source for the human body</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="They contain a complete range of amino acids">They contain a complete range of amino acids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="including all eight essential amino acids">including all eight essential amino acids</span>.</li><li><strong>Carboidrati:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="Red kidney beans also have a high carbohydrate content">Red kidney beans also have a high carbohydrate content</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="with about">with about</span> 56.9 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="grams per">grams per</span> 100 grammi. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="Most of these are complex carbohydrates">Most of these are complex carbohydrates</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="including starch and small amounts of natural sugars">including starch and small amounts of natural sugars</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="These carbohydrates provide energy for the body and help maintain stable blood sugar levels">These carbohydrates provide energy for the body and help maintain stable blood sugar levels</span>.</li><li><strong>Fibra:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="They are rich in dietary fiber">They are rich in dietary fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="with around">with around</span> 8.3 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="grams of crude fiber per">grams of crude fiber per</span> 100 grammi. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="Dietary fiber helps promote intestinal peristalsis">Dietary fiber helps promote intestinal peristalsis</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="improve constipation">improve constipation</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="and maintain gut health">and maintain gut health</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="Fats">Fats</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="Red kidney beans are low in fat">Red kidney beans are low in fat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="containing only about">containing only about</span> 1.3 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="grams per">grams per</span> 100 grammi. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="The fats present are primarily beneficial monounsaturated and polyunsaturated fatty acids">The fats present are primarily beneficial monounsaturated and polyunsaturated fatty acids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="which have various health benefits">which have various health benefits</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="such as lowering cholesterol and reducing the risk of cardiovascular diseases">such as lowering cholesterol and reducing the risk of cardiovascular diseases</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Vitamins">Vitamins</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="They are rich in vitamins">They are rich in vitamins</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="including B vitamins">including B vitamins</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="such as B1">such as B1</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="B2">B2</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="vitamin C">vitamin C</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="and vitamin E">and vitamin E</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="These vitamins play important roles in immune function">These vitamins play important roles in immune function</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="skin health">skin health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="and antioxidant activity">and antioxidant activity</span>.</li><li><strong>Minerali:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="Red kidney beans are abundant in various minerals like calcium">Red kidney beans are abundant in various minerals like calcium</span>, ferro, potassio, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="and magnesium">and magnesium</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="Their calcium content is particularly high">Their calcium content is particularly high</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="exceeding that of chicken by more than seven times">exceeding that of chicken by more than seven times</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="while their iron content is four times that of chicken">while their iron content is four times that of chicken</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="These minerals contribute to bone health">These minerals contribute to bone health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="blood production">blood production</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="and electrolyte balance">and electrolyte balance</span>.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Are_Red_Kidney_Beans_and_Dark_Red_Kidney_Beans_the_Same_Variety"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="Are Red Kidney Beans and Dark Red Kidney Beans the Same Variety">Are Red Kidney Beans and Dark Red Kidney Beans the Same Variety</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><figure id="attachment_497-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-497-2" style="width: 614px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/dark-red-kidney-beans-300x295.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-497" alt="dark red kidney beans" width="624" height="614" title="Cosa sono i fagioli rossiurLo sai davvero?ly Know? 7" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-497-2" class="wp-caption-text">fagioli dei reni rosso scuro</figcaption></figure><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="Red kidney beans and dark red kidney beans are not entirely the same but do overlap">Red kidney beans and dark red kidney beans are not entirely the same but do overlap</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="Dark red kidney beans">Dark red kidney beans</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-