ata-source="" data-orig="consider the following aspects">consider the following aspects</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_267" data-source="" data-orig="Color">Color</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_268" data-source="" data-orig="Quality red kidney beans should have the inherent bright color of the variety">Quality red kidney beans should have the inherent bright color of the variety</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_269" data-source="" data-orig="If the beans are vibrant and glossy">If the beans are vibrant and glossy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_270" data-source="" data-orig="it indicates good quality">it indicates good quality</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_271" data-source="" data-orig="dull or lackluster beans may be of inferior quality">dull or lackluster beans may be of inferior quality</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_272" data-source="" data-orig="Texture">Texture</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_273" data-source="" data-orig="Full and uniformly shaped beans are important characteristics of high-quality red kidney beans">Full and uniformly shaped beans are important characteristics of high-quality red kidney beans</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_274" data-source="" data-orig="Beans that are shriveled">Beans that are shriveled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_275" data-source="" data-orig="incomplete">incomplete</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_276" data-source="" data-orig="uneven in size">uneven in size</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_277" data-source="" data-orig="or have broken or missing parts are of lower quality">or have broken or missing parts are of lower quality</span>. Inoltre, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_278" data-source="" data-orig="good red kidney beans should be dry and clear">good red kidney beans should be dry and clear</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_279" data-source="" data-orig="with no signs of pests or mold">with no signs of pests or mold</span>.</li><li><strong><spa