<strong>Refrigerazione:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_301" data-source="" data-orig="Steam the beans until semi-cooked">Steam the beans until semi-cooked</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_302" data-source="" data-orig="cool them">cool them</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_303" data-source="" data-orig="seal them in a fresh-keeping bag">seal them in a fresh-keeping bag</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_304" data-source="" data-orig="and store them in the refrigerator to extend their shelf life">and store them in the refrigerator to extend their shelf life</span>.<br />
